<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Word Ladder</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#ffffff; --txt:#1a1a1a; --dim:#8a8f98; --line:#e6e8eb;
    --tile:#eceef1; --green:#43a047; --greentxt:#ffffff; --bad:#e5484d;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--txt);
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;
    padding:34px 16px 40px;
  }
  .iconbtn{position:fixed; top:16px; width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%;
    border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:#fff; color:var(--dim); cursor:pointer;
    font-size:16px; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;}
  .iconbtn:hover{color:var(--txt); border-color:var(--dim);}
  #rulesBtn{right:16px;}

  .goal{display:flex; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .goal .t{width:40px; height:46px; border-radius:9px; background:var(--green);
    color:var(--greentxt); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-weight:800; font-size:22px;}
  .count{color:var(--dim); font-size:13px; margin-bottom:22px; height:16px;}
  .ladder{display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:18px;}
  .row{display:flex; gap:6px; animation:pop .18s ease;}
  .tile{width:44px; height:50px; border-radius:9px; background:var(--tile); color:var(--txt);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:800; font-size:24px;}
  .tile.green{background:var(--green); color:var(--greentxt);}
  @keyframes pop{from{transform:translateY(-5px);opacity:0} to{transform:none;opacity:1}}

  .inputrow{display:flex; gap:6px; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .cell{width:44px; height:50px; text-align:center; background:#fff;
    border:2px solid var(--line); color:var(--txt); border-radius:9px;
    font-size:24px; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; outline:none; padding:0; caret-color:var(--green);}
  .cell:focus{border-color:var(--green);}
  .err{color:var(--bad); font-size:13px; height:18px; margin-bottom:16px; font-weight:600;}
  .win{color:var(--green); font-weight:700; font-size:15px; height:20px; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .tools{display:flex; gap:20px;}
  .tools button{background:none; border:none; color:var(--dim); font-size:13px;
    cursor:pointer; padding:4px; font-weight:600;}
  .tools button:hover{color:var(--txt);}

  .home{position:fixed; inset:0; background:#fff; z-index:15; display:flex;
    flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; padding:20px;}
  .home.hide{display:none;}
  .home h1{font-size:34px; font-weight:800; margin:0; letter-spacing:-.5px;}
  .home .tag{color:var(--dim); font-size:15px; margin:2px 0 22px; text-align:center;}
  .home .play{border:none; border-radius:12px; background:var(--green); color:#fff;
    font-size:17px; font-weight:800; padding:14px 54px; cursor:pointer; margin-top:26px;}
  .home .play:hover{filter:brightness(1.05);}
  .home .link{background:none; border:none; color:var(--dim); font-size:14px;
    cursor:pointer; margin-top:14px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline;}
  .home .goal{transform:scale(1.15); margin-bottom:4px;}

  .overlay{position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,.35); display:none;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:20px; z-index:30;}
  .overlay.show{display:flex;}
  .sheet{background:#fff; border-radius:16px; padding:24px 22px; max-width:340px; width:100%;
    box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.2);}
  .sheet h2{margin:0 0 12px; font-size:18px;}
  .sheet p{margin:0 0 10px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a4f57;}
  .sheet .close{margin-top:8px; width:100%; padding:11px; border:none; border-radius:10px;
    background:var(--green); color:#fff; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="home" id="home">
    <h1>Word Ladder</h1>
    <div class="goal" id="homeGoal"></div>
    <div class="tag">Change one letter at a time to reach GAME.</div>
    <button class="play" id="playBtn">Play</button>
    <button class="link" id="homeRules">How to play</button>
  </div>

  <button class="iconbtn" id="rulesBtn" title="How to play">?</button>

  <div class="goal" id="goal"></div>
  <div class="count" id="count"></div>

  <div class="ladder" id="ladder"></div>

  <div class="win" id="win"></div>
  <div class="inputrow" id="inputrow">
    <input class="cell" maxlength="1" inputmode="latin" autocomplete="off">
    <input class="cell" maxlength="1" inputmode="latin" autocomplete="off">
    <input class="cell" maxlength="1" inputmode="latin" autocomplete="off">
    <input class="cell" maxlength="1" inputmode="latin" autocomplete="off">
  </div>
  <div class="err" id="err"></div>

  <div class="tools">
    <button id="newBtn">New</button>
    <button id="hintBtn">Hint</button>
    <button id="undoBtn">Undo</button>
  </div>

  <div class="overlay" id="overlay">
    <div class="sheet">
      <h2>How to play</h2>
      <p>Change one letter each turn to make a new real word.</p>
      <p>Keep going until you reach <b style="color:var(--green)">GAME</b>. A square turns green when a letter is in its final spot.</p>
      <p><b>Hint</b> suggests a next word · <b>New</b> starts a fresh puzzle · <b>Undo</b> takes back a rung.</p>
      <button class="close" id="closeRules">Got it</button>
    </div>
  </div>

